These fixtures come from MRML, https://github.com/jdrouet/mrml, at tag
mrml-v6.0.1 (commit 38c7040988f1c986a2c088437c9b78e34fd077e8):
packages/mrml-core/resources/compare/success/*.mjml and
packages/mrml-core/resources/compare/error/*.mjml.

Only the fixtures that mjml/testdata does not already hold byte for byte are
copied; the other 146 are covered there. The .html and .error files beside
them are not MRML's: scripts/differential.sh renders them with the MJML
pinned in mjml/testdata/reference.

